{"route":"/news-highlights/687-stakeholders-meeting-on-phytopharmaceutical-drugs-monograph-development","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development"}],"updated":"2020-05-26","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/687-stakeholders-meeting-on-phytopharmaceutical-drugs-monograph-development.html","title":"Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development","bodyHtml":"<p>“A stakeholders meeting for the development of phytopharmaceutical drugs monographs comprising cannabis as a medicinal plant of priority, Under the chairmanship of Prof. S. S. Handa, former Director, CSIR-IIIM, Jammu and Dr. G. N. Singh, Secretary-cum-Scientific Director, IPC, held at Indian Pharmacopoeia commission, Ghaziabad, on 23.07.2019.</p>\n<p>Renowned subject experts, Regulators and Stakeholders discussed collaboratively in each and every aspect of cannabis and other phytopharmaceutical drugs monographs.</p>\n<p>A road map was structured and finalized at the meeting around the development of phytopharmaceutical drugs monograph keep special emphasis on cannabis.”</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1607.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1637.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1691.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1698.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1719.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1723.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1753.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1769.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/IMG_1831.JPG\" alt=\"Image: Stakeholders Meeting on Phytopharmaceutical Drugs Monograph Development\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>","date":"2019-07-24","category":"Publications & Standards"}